{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-7558415","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【活动】2016伦敦宝可梦媒体之旅","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"增田顺一在伦敦接受《宝可梦太阳·月亮》媒体采访，记录夜晚街景、美食与紧张兴奋的媒体巡回。","date":"2016-09-28","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · メディアツアー @ London","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · メディアツアー @ London","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/7558415.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20161006081134id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/7558415.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[{"name":"宝可梦 太阳·月亮","slug":"sun-moon"}],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","日記"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":241,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-7558415/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7558415/002-15e4ac8711.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[621,840],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"增田顺一在伦敦接受《宝可梦太阳·月亮》媒体采访，记录夜晚街景、美食与紧张兴奋的媒体巡回。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">为了接受《宝可梦 太阳・月亮》的采访</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">我来到伦敦啦！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">从夜晚的摄政街发来！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7558415/002-15e4ac8711.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7558415/002-15e4ac8711.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n走在皮卡迪利圆环车站附近时，\n\n红色的双层巴士一辆接一辆地飞驰而过！真有伦敦的感觉！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后昨晚\n\n<br>\n\n\n靠这个来提升力量（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n↓\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n龙虾！不知为什么有三只手（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n从今天开始\n\n大森君和我增田\n\n一直在接受媒体采访！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n关于《太阳・月亮》\n\n我们聊了各种各样的话题哦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n至于拍摄的内容嘛，敬请期待（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n在伦敦接受24家媒体采访之后\n\n计划前往旧金山！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n正是\n\n媒体巡回之旅！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n不知道会冒出什么样的问题\n\n真让人期待！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！\n\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ポケモン サン・ムーンの取材を受けに</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ロンドンに来ています！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">夜のリージェントという場所から！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7558415/002-15e4ac8711.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/7558415/002-15e4ac8711.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\nピカデリーサーカス駅近くを歩いていると\n\n赤い2回建てバスがガンガン通ります！ロンドンらしい！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして昨夜は\n\n<br>\n\n\nこれでパワーアップ（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n↓\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\nロブスター！何故か手が3つあった（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして本日から\n大森くんと増田で\nメディアの取材を受けまくってます！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nサン・ムーンについて\nいろいろと語ってますよ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n何を撮影しているかは出てのお楽しみ（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nロンドンで取材を24社受けた後\nサンフランシスコに移動予定！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nまさに\nメディアツアー！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nどんな質問が飛び出すのか\n楽しみです！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n<br></div>"}}